<title>BRAZIL: RESEARCH ALERT - TV Filme downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TV Filme downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded TV Filme Inc to market perform from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- TV Filme lost 3/4 to 10-5/8.</p>
</text>
